OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThere will be variable cloud
OL,6,Fand a few bright or sunny intervals.
OL,7,FThere will be a few light showers but
OL,8,Fmost of the time it will be dry.
OL,9,FStrong southeasterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be mostly cloudy with
OL,12,Foccasional showers and one or two
OL,13,Fclear intervals. The strong
OL,14,Fsoutheasterly winds will persist.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FA cloudy day with outbreaks
OL,17,Fof rain, these showery over Shetland
OL,18,Fwith some drier spells but becoming
OL,19,Fmore persistent over Orkney. Winds
OL,20,Feasing slightly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
